              "# China Economic Outlook: Q1 2018\n## Baseline Outlook: Economy will slow down, but growth will be more balanced\nIn 2018-2019, business investment growth is likely to suffer further declines due to production capacity cuts and stricter pollution controls, while strong consumer spending growth will play a bigger economic role. GDP growth is forecast at 6.2-6.8% in 2018 and 5.9-6.7% in 2019",
